{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08045","headline":"久别离 · 李白","name":"久别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别来几春未还家，玉窗五见樱桃花。\n况有锦字书，开缄使人嗟。\n至此肠断彼心绝，云鬟绿鬓罢梳结，愁如回飙乱白雪。\n去年寄书报阳台，今年寄书重相催。\n东风兮东风，爲我吹行云使西来。\n待来竟不来，落花寂寂委清苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}